# dist/ is committed on purpose: it is what makes this repository installable as
# a Claude Code plugin with no npm registry, no publish step and no token. See
# docs/adr/ADR-0011-plugin-first-distribution.md.
#
# It is generated, so it should not read as authored code: collapsed in review,
# excluded from language stats, and never offered as a merge to resolve by hand.
# CI rebuilds it and fails if a byte differs from src/, so the copy here is
# checkable rather than trusted.
dist/** linguist-generated=true
dist/** -diff
dist/** -merge
